+---
+id: task-003-long-stay-discount
+type: task
+title: "Long-stay discount"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+# Long-stay discount
+
+A rental of 3 days or more costs 10% less than its full price (days x daily price). `quote` and `book`
+both return the reduced total.
+
+## Acceptance
+
+- Rentals of 1 or 2 days are unchanged; 3 days or more get 10% off.
+- The reduced total is an integer number of cents, rounded to the nearest cent (halves round up).
+- `book` returns the same reduced total as `quote`.
